{"seq":3,"slug":"alternatives-comparison","title":"大学工程管理 — 多方案比选与敏感性分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/engineering-economics/alternatives-comparison","wordCount":1631,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学工程管理-多方案比选与敏感性分析\">大学工程管理 — 多方案比选与敏感性分析</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>现实中的工程决策很少是&quot;做或不做&quot;的单选题，更多是&quot;在几个可行方案里选最优&quot;的多选题：钢结构还是混凝土结构？买新设备还是租赁？高初投资低运营费的方案，对比低初投资高运营费的方案，哪个更划算？这就是<strong>多方案比选</strong>要解决的问题。它的核心难点在于&quot;公平比较&quot;——当方案的寿命期不同、规模不同、收益口径不同时，不能简单比总价，必须用统一的尺子来量。</p>\n<p>另一个绕不开的现实是<strong>不确定性</strong>。所有评价都建立在对未来的假设上（折现率多少、收益多高、成本会不会涨），而未来从不会完全按假设走。<strong>敏感性分析</strong> 就是用来回答&quot;如果假设错了，结论会不会翻车&quot;——它找出哪些因素最致命，帮助决策者识别风险、心中有数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"互斥方案-vs-独立方案\">互斥方案 vs 独立方案</h3><p>先分清两类决策：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>独立方案</strong>：彼此不冲突，预算够就都能上（如同时建食堂和宿舍）。评价标准简单——只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NPV &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 就接受。</li>\n<li><strong>互斥方案</strong>：只能选其一（同一块地，盖商场还是盖写字楼）。这才是比选的难点，要在所有可行方案中挑 NPV 最大的那个。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工程中的方案比较大多是互斥的，所以下面重点讲互斥方案如何公平比较。</p>\n<h3 id=\"难点一-寿命期不同怎么办\">难点一：寿命期不同怎么办？</h3><p>设备 A 寿命 6 年、设备 B 寿命 9 年，能直接比 NPV 吗？不能——B 多用 3 年，自然现金流更多，这对 A 不公平。两种标准解法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>最小公倍数法</strong>：把两方案都&quot;重复&quot;到寿命的最小公倍数（6 和 9 的最小公倍数是 18 年），即假设方案到期后原样重置，再比 18 年的总 NPV。</li>\n<li><strong>年等额成本/年金法（EAC）</strong>：把每个方案的总现值摊销成&quot;每年等额的成本&quot;，直接比谁的年成本低。这是更常用、更简洁的方法。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>年等额成本公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>成本</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EAC = \\frac{NPV_{成本}}{(P/A, i, n)},\\quad (P/A, i, n) = \\frac{(1+i)^n - 1}{i(1+i)^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>算例</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i = 8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span> 下比较两台设备（只比成本）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>初投资</th>\n<th>年运营费</th>\n<th>寿命</th>\n<th>现值总成本</th>\n<th>年金系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(P/A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>年等额成本 EAC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>50 万</td>\n<td>12 万/年</td>\n<td>6 年</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4.623</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>105.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 + 12 \\times 4.623 = 105.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.623</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">105.5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>4.623</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>105.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4.623</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>22.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">105.5 / 4.623 = 22.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">105.5/4.623</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22.8</span></span></span></span></span> 万/年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>80 万</td>\n<td>9 万/年</td>\n<td>9 年</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6.247</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>136.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80 + 9 \\times 6.247 = 136.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.247</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">136.2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>6.247</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>136.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6.247</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>21.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">136.2 / 6.247 = 21.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">136.2/6.247</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21.8</span></span></span></span></span> 万/年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结论：尽管 B 初投资高得多，但摊到每年，B 的年成本（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>21.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21.8</span></span></span></span></span> 万）反而低于 A（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">22.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22.8</span></span></span></span></span> 万）。在长期看，<strong>B 更划算</strong>。这个例子说明：只看初投资会严重误判，必须用统一口径（年等额成本）才能公平比较寿命不同的方案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"难点二-未来不确定怎么办-敏感性分析\">难点二：未来不确定怎么办？敏感性分析</h3><p>上面的结论建立在一堆假设上：折现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span>、年运营费、寿命……万一运营费涨了、或折现率变了，结论还成立吗？敏感性分析就是逐一改变这些关键变量，观察结论对它们有多&quot;敏感&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[基准方案 NPV] --&gt; B[折现率 ±2%]&#10;    A --&gt; C[年收益 ±10%]&#10;    A --&gt; D[初投资 ±10%]&#10;    A --&gt; E[运营成本 ±10%]&#10;    B --&gt; F[谁让 NPV 翻负, 谁就是关键风险]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F\">graph LR\n    A[基准方案 NPV] --&gt; B[折现率 ±2%]\n    A --&gt; C[年收益 ±10%]\n    A --&gt; D[初投资 ±10%]\n    A --&gt; E[运营成本 ±10%]\n    B --&gt; F[谁让 NPV 翻负, 谁就是关键风险]\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F</pre><p>做法是：固定其他变量，单独让一个变量上下浮动一定幅度，看 NPV 变化多大。<strong>变化越大的变量越&quot;敏感&quot;，就是项目的关键风险点</strong>，需要重点监控或采取对冲措施。例如若分析发现&quot;原材料价格每涨 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>，NPV 就转负&quot;，那原材料价格就是这个项目的命门——管理者应锁定长期供货合同来对冲。</p>\n<h3 id=\"进阶-盈亏平衡与场景分析\">进阶：盈亏平衡与场景分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>盈亏平衡分析</strong>：找出让 NPV（或利润）恰好为零的临界点。例如算出&quot;年产量低于 8000 件项目就亏&quot;，这个 8000 件就是安全边界。</li>\n<li><strong>场景分析</strong>：不再单变量，而是构造&quot;乐观/最可能/悲观&quot;三套整体场景，分别算 NPV，看最坏情况能否承受。比敏感性分析更贴近现实，因为多个变量往往同向变化（经济下行时收益降、成本升会同时发生）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些工具的共同目的，是把&quot;对未来的赌博&quot;变成&quot;心中有数的风险管理&quot;——这也正是第四章风险管理的前奏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>区分&quot;独立方案&quot;和&quot;互斥方案&quot;，各举一个工程例子。它们的评价标准有何不同？</li>\n<li>为什么寿命期不同的方案不能直接比 NPV？最小公倍数法和年等额成本法各有什么优劣？</li>\n<li>重做本节设备算例：若折现率改为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12%</span></span></span></span></span>，重新计算 A、B 的年等额成本，结论会变吗？</li>\n<li>某项目敏感性分析显示&quot;售价&quot;是最敏感变量。作为管理者，你会采取哪些措施来对冲售价下跌的风险？</li>\n<li>场景分析相比单变量敏感性分析&quot;更贴近现实&quot;，原因是什么？请举例说明多个变量同向变化的情况。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>《工程经济学》——方案比选与不确定性分析章节</li>\n<li>《Engineering Economy》（Sullivan 等）——年等额成本法与最小公倍数法的标准讲解</li>\n<li>Excel 的&quot;模拟运算表/单变量求解&quot;——动手做敏感性与盈亏平衡分析</li>\n<li>蒙特卡洛模拟入门——把&quot;三场景&quot;升级为成千上万次随机模拟的进阶方法</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多方案比选要解决&quot;公平比较&quot;问题：独立方案各看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NPV &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 即可，互斥方案需在可行集中选 NPV 最大者。寿命期不同时，用最小公倍数法或更简洁的年等额成本法（EAC）统一口径——本节算例证明，只看初投资会误判，高初投资方案摊到每年反而可能更省。面对未来不确定性，敏感性分析逐一扰动关键变量、找出最致命的风险点，盈亏平衡和场景分析则进一步刻画安全边界与最坏情形。至此第二章完成，你已能用货币语言评价和选择工程方案。下一章我们转向工程的两条生命线——质量与安全。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学工程管理 — 多方案比选与敏感性分析","id":"大学工程管理-多方案比选与敏感性分析"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"互斥方案 vs 独立方案","id":"互斥方案-vs-独立方案"},{"level":3,"text":"难点一：寿命期不同怎么办？","id":"难点一-寿命期不同怎么办"},{"level":3,"text":"难点二：未来不确定怎么办？敏感性分析","id":"难点二-未来不确定怎么办-敏感性分析"},{"level":3,"text":"进阶：盈亏平衡与场景分析","id":"进阶-盈亏平衡与场景分析"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学工程管理 — 投资评价指标（NPV / IRR / 回收期）","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/engineering-economics/investment-appraisal-criteria"},"next":{"title":"大学工程管理 — 质量管理体系与 PDCA","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/construction-quality-safety/quality-management-system"}}